   "value": "scan3 = scan[3]; scan4 = scan[4];\nallScan = Join[scan2, scan3, scan4];\n(* configurations with an LR selection rule (no non-LR state couples, some non-BPS LR state does), and the opposite *)\nlrRule = Select[allScan, #[[5]] == 0 && #[[6]] > 0 &];\nantiRule = Select[allScan, #[[5]] > 0 && #[[6]] == 0 &];\nnoneCouple = Select[allScan, #[[5]] == 0 && #[[6]] == 0 &];\nGrid[{{\"# configurations scanned (L = 2, 3, 4)\", Length[allScan]},\n  {\"LR selection rule (only LR states couple)\", If[lrRule === {}, \"none\", lrRule]},\n  {\"anti-LR (only non-LR states couple)\", antiRule},\n  {\"nothing non-BPS couples\", noneCouple[[All, 1 ;; 4]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
