  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result — uniform-in-L hits (same polarisations at L = 2, 3, 4):**\n- P: (a) generic orbit (= the note's configuration), ℓ = 1 and 2L−1, both starts; (b) half-degenerate orbits at ℓ = 1 (a₂·f₁ = 0 starting on A, a₁·f₂ = 0 starting on F); (c) both-zero orbit, ℓ = 2 and 2L−2, both starts.\n- LP: no uniform hit (only isolated L = 2 or L = 4 cases).\n\n### Operator check: B·X_P(u) r = 0 (all states, not only HW cyclic)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "opCheck[L_, orbName_, l_, start_, kind_] := Module[{LL = 2 L, b2 = SelectFirst[orbits, #[[1]] == orbName &][[2]], B, rs, us = {0.37, -0.61, 1.13}},\n   B = braConf[LL, start, l, b2, IdentityMatrix[4]]; SeedRandom[300 + L]; rs = Table[RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, 4^LL], 2];\n   Max[Flatten[Table[With[{y = Xop[kind, LL][uu, r]}, Abs[B . y]/(Norm[B] Norm[y])], {uu, us}, {r, rs}]]]];\ncases = {{\"generic (note)\", 1, 1}, {\"generic (note)\", 1, 2}, {\"a2.f1 = 0\", 1, 1}, {\"a1.f2 = 0\", 1, 2}, {\"both 0\", 2, 1}, {\"both 0\", 2, 2}, {\"generic (note)\", 2, 1}};\nopRows = Table[{c[[1]], c[[2]], If[c[[3]] == 1, \"A\", \"F\"], Sequence @@ Table[ScientificForm[opCheck[L, c[[1]], c[[2]], c[[3]], \"P\"], 2], {L, {2, 3, 4}}]}, {c, cases}];\nGrid[Prepend[opRows, {\"orbit\", \"ℓ\", \"start\", \"L = 2\", \"L = 3\", \"L = 4\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
