  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** the full operator identity fails (10⁻¹–10⁻³) — expected, since B is not translation invariant. Only cyclic (single-trace) states enter the 3-pt function, so the relevant statement is that the translation-averaged bra Σ_k ⟨B|S^k is annihilated: B·X_P(u) r = 0 for cyclic kets r = Σ_k S^k r₀ (all weight sectors, all multiplets).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pairShift[LL_][psi_] := Flatten[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, {16, 4^(LL - 2)}]]];\ncyc[LL_][r_] := Total[NestList[pairShift[LL], r, LL/2 - 1]];\nopCheckCyc[L_, orbName_, l_, start_, kind_] := Module[{LL = 2 L, b2 = SelectFirst[orbits, #[[1]] == orbName &][[2]], B, rs, us = {0.37, -0.61, 1.13}},\n   B = braConf[LL, start, l, b2, IdentityMatrix[4]]; SeedRandom[400 + L]; rs = Table[cyc[LL][RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, 4^LL]], 2];\n   Max[Flatten[Table[With[{y = Xop[kind, LL][uu, r]}, Abs[B . y]/(Norm[B] Norm[y])], {uu, us}, {r, rs}]]]];\nopRowsC = Table[{c[[1]], c[[2]], If[c[[3]] == 1, \"A\", \"F\"], Sequence @@ Table[ScientificForm[opCheckCyc[L, c[[1]], c[[2]], c[[3]], \"P\"], 2], {L, {2, 3, 4}}]}, {c, cases}];\nGrid[Prepend[opRowsC, {\"orbit\", \"ℓ\", \"start\", \"L = 2\", \"L = 3\", \"L = 4\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
